# BisectHosting

BisectHosting is a game server hosting company founded in 2011. It operates under Venture Node LLC (Ohio, USA), supports 100+ games under a unified plan called BisectOne, and serves customers in 130+ countries from 21 global data center locations. Starting price: ~$2.99/GB per month. Support: 24/7/365 via live chat and ticket services, and an average ticket response time under 15 minutes.

