## Glossary

**BisectOne** — Current all-in-one game server hosting plan. 100+ games on one subscription, priced per GB RAM. Includes game swapping, instances, backups, DDoS protection. No hardware upsells.

**BisectBoost** — Account-wide add-on (not a standalone plan). Adds extra instance slots, backup storage, premium subdomains, and temporary RAM boosting. Not included in base BisectOne.

**Starbase Panel** — BisectHosting's custom game server control panel. Features: start/stop/restart, live console, file manager, FTP, config editor, backup manager, scheduled tasks, live metrics, mod/plugin management.

**ServerSpawn** — Proprietary auto-provisioning system. Deploys and configures each new server based on game requirements immediately after purchase. No manual setup needed.

**Instance** — An independent saved server environment (game, world, modpack, config) that can be switched to without losing data. Active and runnable. Not the same as a backup.

**Backup** — A stored snapshot of server files for restoration purposes. Not an active environment. Cannot be "switched to" — must be restored to overwrite current server state.

**Instance Manager** — Starbase Panel tool for creating, saving, and switching between instances with one click.

**Instance Slots** — Number of instances storable on a plan. BisectOne base: 2 slots.

**Instance Storage Pool** — Shared storage for all instances. BisectOne base: 40 GB shared.

**Game Swapping** — Changing the active game on a BisectOne server without buying a new plan. Requires meeting minimum RAM per game. Use Instance Manager beforehand to avoid data loss.

**Unlimited Player Slots** — No platform-imposed player cap. Practical limits are set by game engine behavior and available RAM — not by BisectHosting.

**Backup Slots** — Number of backup snapshots storable at once. BisectOne base: 2 slots.

**Configurable Backups** — Backups triggered manually or on a custom schedule.

**Daily Backups** — Automated daily snapshots. BisectOne retains 3 days of history by default.

**Temporary RAM Boosting** — BisectBoost feature allowing a server to temporarily exceed its base RAM allocation during peak load.

**Premium Subdomains** — Human-readable server addresses (e.g., myserver.bisecthosting.com). BisectBoost add-on feature.

**NVMe SSDs** — High-performance solid-state drives used for all game server storage. Faster load times and lower I/O latency than standard SSDs.

**vCores** — Virtual CPU cores available per server. BisectOne: up to 8. Dynamically allocated in line with fair use policy — not hard-capped per plan.

**DDoS Protection** — Network-level attack mitigation. Included free on all plans.

**Modpack** — Bundled mod collection for a specific game version. BisectHosting offers 2,300+ for Minecraft.

**One-Click Modpack Install** — Starbase Panel feature that installs and configures a modpack automatically.

**Steam Workshop Support** — Game-specific integration for Steam Workshop content. Not universal — check per-game page.

**Server Importing** — Uploading an existing world or server config to BisectHosting's platform.

**FTP Access** — Direct file transfer access via FTP client. Available on all plans.

**Config Editor** — Starbase Panel tool for editing server config files via a UI without direct file access.

**Instant Setup** — Servers go live immediately after purchase via ServerSpawn.

**24/7/365 Support** — Human agent support available at all times via livechat and ticket services.

**Boost Squad** — Discord role tied to BisectBoost add-on. Grants access to exclusive community channels and rewards.

